                                                "sense_id": "d58cf7da-db50-306e-b899-dae927d228b1",
                                                "text": "A Greater Anglia Class 755 stands precariously close to where ballast has been washed away at Haddiscoe on January 30."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
